  "description": "The original source code for Command & Conquer: Red Alert, implementing the core game engine and various subsystems for real-time strategy gameplay. The codebase handles complex unit AI, A* pathfinding, and fog-of-war mechanics alongside vintage multimedia processing for VQ video and ADPCM audio. This archived repository serves as a historical reference for legacy game architecture and community-driven Steam Workshop integration.",
